To generate accurate calculations, the Round Robin Calculator requires specific information from users in the United Kingdom. The minimum number of selections needed is typically three individual picks, each with its own odds. Users must specify odds in either decimal or fractional format, with decimal being the standard format in British sportsbooks. The stake amount represents the wager placed on each individual parlay within the round robin bet. Finally, users select their preferred parlay size, which determines how many selections combine in each parlay. A 2-leg parlay combines two selections, whilst a 3-leg parlay combines three selections from the total pool.
